 "summary": "The PR adds named fixed-chart densities for three families that had none (grep for `AnglePDF` finds hits only in the three changed files), and builds them on existing shared pieces: `AddCircle.map_coe_equivIco_withDensity_haarAddCircle`, `hasPDF_of_hasLaw_withDensity` and `pdf_eq_of_hasLaw_withDensity` (TauCeti/Probability/Density.lean), and Mathlib's `Measure.rnDeriv_withDensity`. The `_eq_ofReal`, measurability and bridge lemmas follow the same per-family pattern used across the distributions library (e.g. `arcsinePDF_eq_ofReal`, `laplacePDF_eq_ofReal`), so they are not redundant wrappers.",
